♪ If you're into fashion ♪

00:41:11.333 --> 00:41:14.073
♪ Or easy home decor ♪

00:41:14.073 --> 00:41:16.418
♪ New favorite recipes ♪

00:41:16.418 --> 00:41:18.827
♪ Plus fun celebrities ♪

00:41:18.827 --> 00:41:20.750
♪ With a little good news ♪

