premiere September 13th.

00:41:41.831 --> 00:41:44.414
(upbeat music)

00:41:45.580 --> 00:41:48.850
- Welcome back, that is
the end of today's trip

00:41:48.850 --> 00:41:52.530
down memory lane, but fret not,

00:41:52.530 --> 00:41:55.960
in less than a week, it's
the season two premiere

